tent": "Imperatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">Imperatives </span> to tell people to do things. The verb has no subject.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Put on your sweater. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Give me the blue shirt. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Please, pass me the pants.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pack", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to place clothes and other objects in luggage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can I help you pack your clothes for your trip?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when packing clothes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "clothes", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the things we wear on our body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What clothes do you need for your trip?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trip", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of time spent away from home", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Where is your trip to?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shirt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing for the upper body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please hand me the blue shirt.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pants", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing for the legs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please pass me the pants on the chair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sweater", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extra clothing for the upper body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need a sweater because it's cold.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "jacket", "type": "name"}, {"content": "extra clothing for the upper body, to go outside", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do I need a jacket?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "skirt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "clothing for the lower body, usually worn by women", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Many women wear skirts.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sneakers", "type": "name"}, {"content": "shoes used for sports", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wear sneakers to play soccer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Uses an appropriate range of basic vocabulary and structures to describe location of classroom objects. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn1le03ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "You want to pack for a trip. With a partner, talk about what things you need to take. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Select 6 - 10 things. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a list. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example:<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Mary</span>: We're going to the beach.<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Joseph</span>: We need to pack our bathing suits.<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Mary</span>: Yes! Some sunscreen, too!<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Joseph</span>: Good idea. What else do we need? \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I discuss a trip with a partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of things to take on a trip.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}